Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.05,0:00:09.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有可依靠的人  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no one at all, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.36,0:00:10.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.33,0:00:13.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,八个月前他在阿富汗牺牲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He died in Afghanistan eight months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.59,0:00:18.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-小卡  -你好  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cass. - Hello, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:20.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我带出炼狱不是你的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting me out of purgatory wasn't your responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.52,0:00:23.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我挣脱开的  我需要苦行赎罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pulled away. I needed to do penance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.16,0:00:26.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了我在天堂和人间犯下那么多罪孽\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the things I did on earth and in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.87,0:00:29.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是怎么出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How...the hell did you make it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.90,0:00:33.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫娜奥米  我们救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Naomi. We rescued you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.12,0:00:35.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的对话就算是你的报答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider these chats your repayment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.72,0:00:37.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要定期向我汇报\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will report in to me regularly,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.32,0:00:39.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你永远不会记得你这么做过\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you will never remember having done so.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.71,0:00:42.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:44.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(俄克拉荷马州  俄克拉荷马市)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.63,0:00:51.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.16,0:00:56.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥利维亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.45,0:01:01.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上次之后  我没想到你还会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}After last time, I-I didn't think that you would come.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.42,0:01:03.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来没打算来  但是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't going to, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.58,0:01:05.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很高兴你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.59,0:01:08.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.17,0:01:13.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.25,0:01:15.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.19,0:01:17.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怦怦跳动的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thumping noise? 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.41,0:01:19.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is -- is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.06,0:01:21.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能听见\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.72,0:01:24.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.12,0:01:26.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:29.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖理  是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary, what is it?! What --
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.76,0:01:32.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖理  盖理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary! Gary!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.14,0:01:37.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.14,0:01:42.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第8季第8集]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.83,0:01:45.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.86,0:01:49.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  只要你发现什么就立刻打给我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, just, uh -- just call us whenever you find something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.25,0:01:49.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.87,0:01:51.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.50,0:01:53.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, course.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.73,0:01:55.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  不是  我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. No, I-I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:58.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  你知道吗  迪恩在我旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, hey, you know what? Uh, Dean's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.24,0:02:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想和你说两句\N{\fnArial\fs30}He really wants to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.99,0:02:04.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谭夫人  对  你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Tran, yeah, hi, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.60,0:02:06.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,隧道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.52,0:02:09.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谭家那边又怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on in Tran-land?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:11.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖思最终把他们带去了他的船屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, Garth finally got them to his houseboat,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.21,0:02:12.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是凯文要阅读他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Kevin's having a lot of trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.26,0:02:13.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那半石碑是困难重重\N{\fnArial\fs30}reading their half of the tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.70,0:02:15.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到目前为止  都是些零零碎碎的  \N{\fnArial\fs30}So far, bits and pieces. 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.96,0:02:17.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有关于封闭地狱的内容\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing about boarding up hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.77,0:02:19.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖思有艘安全船屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garth has a safe-houseboat?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.39,0:02:22.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老兄  我都不再问这些问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, I don't even ask questions anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.67,0:02:27.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  有什么消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the word, Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.67,0:02:29.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.41,0:02:29.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我昵称\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a shortened version of my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.35,0:02:33.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  但我问的是道上有什么消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is. I meant what's the word on the word?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.51,0:02:36.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使"无线电"里有没有关于石碑的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any, uh, tablet chatter on angel radio?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.36,0:02:39.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不准  我把那关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I couldn't say. I turned that off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.54,0:02:41.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你可以关掉吗  -是的  只不过是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can do that? - Yeah, it's a simple matter
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.05,0:02:42.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阻隔住特定的次音速频率\N{\fnArial\fs30}of blocking out certain subsonic frequencies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.98,0:02:43.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们想了解我可以画图表解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could draw you a diagram if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.96,0:02:45.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用  这样就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's -- we're good. 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.49,0:02:48.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you flip the switch?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.07,0:02:51.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为那能直接连接到天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's a direct link to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.10,0:02:55.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不想和那地方有所牵连\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't want anything to do with that place -- not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.15,0:02:58.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那现在要怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.34,0:03:01.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搬去佛蒙特  开一家迷人的小旅馆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move to Vermont, open up a charming B&B?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.90,0:03:05.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要  我还想...我还得去帮助人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I still want -- I still need to help people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.82,0:03:09.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  我要做个猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...I'm gonna become a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.39,0:03:16.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.34,0:03:18.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的  我可以做你们的电灯泡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I could be your third wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.34,0:03:18.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.36,0:03:20.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道那不是件好事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that's not a good thing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.76,0:03:23.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然是  多一个人能多一份握力能更加稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course it is. A third wheel adds extra grip, greater stability.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.05,0:03:26.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我甚至都找好案子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I even found a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:27.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俄克拉荷马市  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Oklahoma city -- 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.38,0:03:29.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一男子心脏从胸膛中跳出十英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}a man's heart jumped 10 feet out of his chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.80,0:03:31.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听起来是我们的案子  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sounds like our kind of thing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.70,0:03:36.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他说得对  -太好了  到那儿见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's got a point.  - Excellent. I'll see you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.15,0:03:37.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  小卡  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, Cass, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.97,0:03:40.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想扮牛仔吸血鬼什么的  没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to play cowboys and bloodsuckers, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.30,0:03:41.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你要和我们在一起  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're gonna stick with us, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.37,0:03:44.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要再做这种傻事  明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of this zapping around crap. Capiche?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.90,0:03:46.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I capiche.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.34,0:03:48.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.57,0:03:52.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能坐在副驾驶座上吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I, uh, at least ride in the front seat?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.52,0:03:54.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行  不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.13,0:04:04.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法医说他的心脏从身体里喷射出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coroner said his heart was ejected from his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.07,0:04:06.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呼吸新鲜空气  在沙盒里找到它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got some air, too. Found it in a sandbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.47,0:04:08.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,探长  你有何看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any idea what happened, detective?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.17,0:04:11.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纳什探员  许多人都认为是吸毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of people are thinking drugs, agent Nash --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.13,0:04:12.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吸毒过量\N{\fnArial\fs30}An assload of drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.73,0:04:14.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男人体内没有毒品\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no narcotics in that man's system.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.70,0:04:15.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的分子都错乱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His molecules are all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.96,0:04:18.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你不那么认为对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you don't think that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.97,0:04:21.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从来没见过8号黑球能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never seen an eightball do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.61,0:04:25.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁报的案\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who called this in?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:28.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的朋友奥利维亚·库珀  她目睹了整件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friend of his named Olivia Kopple. She saw the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.63,0:04:33.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死  我得...我得接个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, crap. I have -- I have to take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.89,0:04:35.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是我们所有线索  请自便  谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's everything we got. Knock yourself out. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.56,0:04:37.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  如果你发现什么奇怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you see anything weird,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.66,0:04:39.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任何不同寻常的事  打给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}anything out of the box, you just call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.37,0:04:43.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯科林  你说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you say, Scully.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.12,0:04:46.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格拉斯探长  立刻去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detective Glass. On my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.14,0:04:50.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉不到任何电磁干扰或硫磺\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't sense any EMF or sulfur.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.68,0:04:55.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弗里林先生的动脉很健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Frieling's arterial health is, uh, excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.67,0:05:01.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他近期患有轻度的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did recently suffer from a...mild, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.09,0:05:04.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么来着  膀胱感染\N{\fnArial\fs30}what is that? Bladder infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.01,0:05:05.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  别再闻死人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, stop smelling the dead guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.38,0:05:08.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  现在我了解这男人的一切  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Now I know everything about this man. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.37,0:05:09.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we can --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.20,0:05:11.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道他有外遇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know he was having an affair?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.61,0:05:13.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.51,0:05:15.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神探夏洛克  得一分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strike one, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.24,0:05:16.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据奥利维亚说\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to Olivia,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.45,0:05:18.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们每周四12点45分都会在公园见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}they would meet at the park every Thursday at 12:45,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.98,0:05:20.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走去月光餐厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}walk to the Moonlight Diner,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.27,0:05:22.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她总会点一份凯撒沙拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}where she always ordered a Caesar salad,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.13,0:05:23.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沙拉酱放在旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}dressing on the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.46,0:05:24.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会一起聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}They would chat about everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.47,0:05:27.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,1点30分她会回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she'd be back on the road by 1:30.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.93,0:05:30.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得她说谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think she's telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.42,0:05:32.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太多细节了  听起来像是事先排练过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too much detail. Sounds rehearsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.71,0:05:35.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有  我们进城的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus, we drove past the Moonlight Diner
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.24,0:05:36.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,经过月光餐厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the way into town.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.85,0:05:39.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紧靠着月光汽车旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's attached to the Moonlight Motel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.92,0:05:43.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  假设这位盖理有外遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, let's say that, uh, Gary here's on the prowl,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.56,0:05:47.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是他又谨慎行事因为...\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he's playing it safe because...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.01,0:05:49.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...dude's married.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.86,0:05:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不想被别人看到他的车停在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't want anyone to see his ride parked out 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.20,0:05:53.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,按小时收费的廉价旅馆门口\N{\fnArial\fs30}in front of a by-the-hour fleabag.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.31,0:05:56.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以他就把车藏在街对面的公园里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he stashes his car at the park across the street,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.08,0:05:56.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那里见奥利维亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meets Olivia there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.84,0:05:57.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的妻子可能发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His wife probably found out about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.94,0:06:00.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让她心碎  所以她也弄碎了他的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it broke her heart. So she breaks his.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.50,0:06:01.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着像是巫师一类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds witchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.38,0:06:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.91,0:06:04.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙暗地里玩私情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy was living a lie,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.60,0:06:06.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于给私情玩死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it came back to bite him in the ticker.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.19,0:06:08.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能诊断出膀胱感染也挺厉害的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But nice job on the bladder infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.28,0:06:34.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(艾米利亚与唐白头偕老)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.75,0:06:37.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说五点之前到\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he'd be here by 5:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.01,0:06:39.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,深呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, just deep breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.63,0:06:41.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不会有事的  -我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's gonna be okay. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.92,0:06:44.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是新房子  还有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just this house, you --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.62,0:06:46.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会认为我们进展太快\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna think we're moving too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.51,0:06:49.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有没有进展太快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we moving too fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.18,0:06:53.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是在弥补错过的时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're making up for lost time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.43,0:07:02.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别谈政治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't talk politics.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.17,0:07:04.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说牛仔的坏话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say anything bad about the cowboys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.06,0:07:05.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且无论你做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whatever you do, don't --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.78,0:07:09.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千万别用"潮湿"和"不管"这两个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}do not use the words "moist" or "irregardless."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.06,0:07:11.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的开场白是作废了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There goes my opener.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.34,0:07:16.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.46,0:07:18.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh, munchkin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.38,0:07:19.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  怪丢人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.89,0:07:22.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我的工作  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is my job, kiddo. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.00,0:07:25.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小帅哥是谁呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, who's this handsome fella?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.83,0:07:28.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可是个好小伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's a good boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.23,0:07:31.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么样啊  真帅气\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing there? You're beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.35,0:07:34.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那只好小伙是这位好小伙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That good boy belongs to this good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.93,0:07:38.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯坦·汤普森  这是萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stan Thompson, this is Sam Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.16,0:07:40.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你好  -多有耳闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - I heard a lot about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.23,0:07:41.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望不都是坏话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all bad, I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.17,0:07:47.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地方不错  草坪该剪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this is a nice place. Lawn could use a mow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.27,0:07:49.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆找的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.22,0:07:51.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我最近实在是忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been so busy lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.39,0:07:53.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他差不多是一个人给我们搬的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's had to move us in by himself, pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.09,0:07:57.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也算做得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Job almost well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.55,0:08:01.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸  要饮料吗  我们有啤酒  冰茶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want a drink, dad? We have beer, iced tea --
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.26,0:08:04.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要是凉的就好  谢谢亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything cold will be fantastic. Thank you, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.01,0:08:06.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.27,0:08:10.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,汤普森先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Thompson, um, I just -- 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.80,0:08:12.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道事情很尴尬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know this must be weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.14,0:08:13.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你几个月没见艾米利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you haven't seen Amelia in months,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.70,0:08:15.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她又跟一个你不认识的人住在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now she's living with a guy you've never met.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.64,0:08:17.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾米说你读过斯坦福\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ame said you went to Stanford.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.17,0:08:18.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.77,0:08:20.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是所好学校  -的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a good school. - It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.28,0:08:21.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do you do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.40,0:08:24.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在镇上一家旅馆工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I work at a motel in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.78,0:08:27.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做账吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balancing the books?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.33,0:08:32.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  主要做维修\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no. Maintenance mostly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.38,0:08:36.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就说得通了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.44,0:08:37.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须承认  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I got to say, Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.34,0:08:39.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看你十分欠修理\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like a real fixer-upper to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.09,0:08:47.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.15,0:08:48.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖理死于心脏病发作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary had a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.01,0:08:49.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,联调局怎么会...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would the FBI --
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.10,0:08:51.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,公园是国家财产\N{\fnArial\fs30}The parks are government property.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.19,0:08:53.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只问你几个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just got a few questions for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.21,0:08:56.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll, uh... I'll handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.24,0:08:58.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做过研究  我能撬开她的嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done research. I can crack her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.29,0:09:02.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弗里林夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Ms. Frieling,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.33,0:09:04.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想给你添麻烦  真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to bother you. I-I really don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.76,0:09:08.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是我有一个问题要问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I-I do have just one question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.21,0:09:10.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要杀你丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you kill your husband?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.58,0:09:13.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯蒂尔探员  借一步说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Stills. A word, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.11,0:09:17.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干什么  我在扮黑脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I was being bad cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.25,0:09:18.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你扮的是四不像\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you were being bad everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.72,0:09:19.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  原谅我搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, forgive my partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.84,0:09:22.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他最近有些心事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's, uh -- he's going through some stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.63,0:09:23.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,学学萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.54,0:09:26.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想问的是  有没有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}What he was trying to ask -- is -- is there any way
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.04,0:09:28.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖理有一些秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary might have had secrets -- 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.24,0:09:30.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,隐瞒着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}something he was hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.95,0:09:33.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,隐瞒  隐瞒什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiding? Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.46,0:09:37.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黛比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deb?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.75,0:09:41.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥利维亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.79,0:09:43.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.80,0:09:45.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那个情妇奥利维亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in mistress Olivia?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.43,0:09:47.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尴尬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.30,0:09:52.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  你们说盖理隐瞒了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. W-what did you think Gary was hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.13,0:09:54.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他跟她有一腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That he was sleeping with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.54,0:09:59.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.46,0:10:03.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.23,0:10:05.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖理和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary and I --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.57,0:10:10.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有个约定\N{\fnArial\fs30}we... had an arrangement.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.02,0:10:10.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可以同奥利维亚约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was seeing olivia,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.94,0:10:15.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有时候跟邻居PJ在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I was spending some time with our neighbor P.J.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.06,0:10:18.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去把这个放到厨房\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll, uh -- I'll put this in the kitchen. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.23,0:10:20.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我去帮你  -好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll help. Okay. - Yeah. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.97,0:10:23.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,疯狂的郊区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frigging suburbs, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.52,0:10:24.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说她不是女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}So she's not a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.96,0:10:27.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世上最好的老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the best wife ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.77,0:10:30.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那是什么杀了她丈夫  -谁管...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then what killed her husband? - Who gives a...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.82,0:10:57.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.83,0:11:01.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝要我活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}God wants me to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.72,0:11:19.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像是自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loks like suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.08,0:11:20.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是自杀  留了遗书\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was. Guy left a note.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.92,0:11:22.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他白手起家建了罗马工业\N{\fnArial\fs30}He invested everything in Roman Industries
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.30,0:11:24.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又在去年赔了个一干二净\N{\fnArial\fs30}and lost it all when they crashed and burned last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.44,0:11:26.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那为什么找我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why call us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.08,0:11:27.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为有两名目击者坚称\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I have two witnesses who swear
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.49,0:11:31.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们看到马多夫在空中停了有10秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Madoff here floated in midair for a good 10 seconds,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.38,0:11:33.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后向下一看  才摔下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}then he looked down, and splat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.95,0:11:36.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不确定是不是相信  但是听他们讲来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not sure I buy that, but the way they're talking,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.13,0:11:38.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-简直就像是  -卡通片\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It sounds like something straight out of a... - Cartoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.36,0:11:38.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,探长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.94,0:11:41.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你们说在查怪事  -多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You said you wanted weird. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.21,0:11:45.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-有什么发现  -她说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, what do you got? - She's right, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.05,0:11:47.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看  心从胸膛里跳出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the whole heart jumping out of the guy's chest,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.24,0:11:48.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坠落延迟\N{\fnArial\fs30}the -- the -- the delayed fall --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.49,0:11:50.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全就是兔八哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's straight-up Bugs Bunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.49,0:11:54.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.39,0:11:54.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么我要找的是一只兔虫合体怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're looking for some sort of insect-rabbit hybrid?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.35,0:11:55.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么杀掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we kill it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.04,0:11:56.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀不掉的  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we don't, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.25,0:11:57.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是个动画角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a character, like, uh --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.96,0:12:00.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像啄木鸟伍迪和达菲鸭\N{\fnArial\fs30}like Woody Woodpecker or Daffy Duck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.12,0:12:01.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是动画短片\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're little animated movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.31,0:12:03.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,歪心狼追着哔哔鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, uh, the Coyote chases a roadrunner,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.91,0:12:06.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁砧从天而降砸在他头上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then the -- the anvil gets dropped on his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.84,0:12:09.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这很好笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it supposed to be funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.05,0:12:10.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.62,0:12:13.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是滑稽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.50,0:12:16.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要走开  孩子们  我们马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay tuned, kids! We'll be right back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.88,0:12:19.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.90,0:12:21.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哔哔鸟代表上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bird represents god.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.25,0:12:24.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,歪心狼就是人类  一刻不停地追索神意\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Coyote is man, endlessly chasing the divine,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.74,0:12:27.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却从来求之不得\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet never able to catch him. It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.75,0:12:30.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很滑稽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.16,0:12:34.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全不知道我们要对付的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got no idea what we're hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.46,0:12:35.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是个念相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's a tulpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.46,0:12:35.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.35,0:12:36.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是某个《机械鸡》(2005年上映的美国电视剧)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's some...some crazy god
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.35,0:12:38.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.74,0:12:38.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看多了的疯狂的神\N{\fnArial\fs30}who watched too much "Robot Chicken."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.20,0:12:40.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I...I mean, is there a link
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.76,0:12:42.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这两起事件之间有联系吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}between "Heartbreak hotel" And "Free falling"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.71,0:12:44.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是找不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that I can find.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.54,0:12:46.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我要休息一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, I'm gonna call it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.05,0:12:48.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  你要定个房间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, you gonna book a room or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.09,0:12:49.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'll stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.90,0:12:51.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, okay. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.89,0:12:53.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们开个睡衣派对然后帮萨姆编辫子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have a slumber party and braid Sam's hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.96,0:12:55.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要睡在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you gonna sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.18,0:12:57.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.95,0:12:59.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我需要睡四个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, I need my four hours, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.82,0:13:01.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会看守着你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll watch over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.81,0:13:03.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.84,0:13:07.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警察局发生了一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's coming across the police band.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.08,0:13:08.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能听见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, you can hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.74,0:13:10.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是无线电波\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.07,0:13:15.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一家银行被抢劫了  听起来很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bank has been robbed. It sounds loony.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.82,0:13:17.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么叫疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Define "Loony."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.99,0:13:22.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  这就叫疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's loony, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.06,0:13:26.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特工们  我正要打电话给你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agents. I was just about to give you a ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.71,0:13:29.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得问句  是你们追着疯狂的事件呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to ask...do you boys chase the crazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.02,0:13:31.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是疯狂的事专发生在你们身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}or does the crazy chase you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.40,0:13:32.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要看当天状况了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Depends on the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.28,0:13:34.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这是谁被压成肉饼了  -保安\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's the pancake? - Security guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.40,0:13:35.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他报案有抢劫\N{\fnArial\fs30}He called in reporting a robbery,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.60,0:13:37.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-但当我们赶来时  -抢劫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- but by the time we got here... - A robbery?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.12,0:13:39.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当这个黑洞正在试图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like the Black Hole was trying to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.45,0:13:40.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,撬开保险箱时\N{\fnArial\fs30}jimmy open a safe-deposit box
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.40,0:13:42.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位业余警察发现了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}when Mr. Rent-a-cop found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.22,0:13:45.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后  你们也知道事情的结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, well, you know how that story ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.13,0:13:46.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black Hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.61,0:13:49.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我们对把我们耍得团团转的窃贼的称呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our name for a burglar that's been running us ragged.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.00,0:13:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他很专业  没留下任何指纹\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a pro...no fingerprints,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.80,0:13:52.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有任何强行闯入的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}never any sign of forced entry...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.65,0:13:56.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次只留下一双那东西  就像他留下的签名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a pair of those every time, like he's signing his work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.67,0:14:01.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽管明显  罪犯从没做过这样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perp's never done anything like this before, though...obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.90,0:14:03.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你介意我看一下其他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind if I take a look at your files
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.30,0:14:05.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,类似入室抢劫的资料吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}on those other break-ins?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.14,0:14:05.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}No skin off my nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.95,0:14:07.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在要去警局  若你愿意可以搭顺风车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm headed to the station now if you want a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.99,0:14:09.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.23,0:14:16.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能抬起来它吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Can you lift this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.97,0:14:35.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用X做标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}"X" marks the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.56,0:14:38.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论是谁  都是按照动画片中的规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, whoever's doing this is playing by cartoon rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.79,0:14:41.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-动画片里没有规则  -当然有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Animation doesn't have rules. - Sure it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.75,0:14:43.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在卡通片里  一个美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}In toontown, a pretty girl
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.10,0:14:44.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以让你的心赃跳出胸口\N{\fnArial\fs30}can make your heart leap out of your chest,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.65,0:14:46.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁砧从天而降\N{\fnArial\fs30}anvils fall from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.64,0:14:49.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且如果你在墙上画个门或洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you draw a door or a black hole on the wall,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.56,0:14:51.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就可以穿墙而过\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can stroll right through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.14,0:14:54.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,窃贼就是这样进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is how the thief got in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.72,0:14:58.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是这样出去和破开地下室的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And out, and cracked the vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.09,0:15:02.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那为什么现在不管用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why isn't it working now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.86,0:15:06.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got no clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.37,0:15:10.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.78,0:15:13.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,字写得很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful handwriting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.38,0:15:17.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你感觉怎么样  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you feeling, cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.66,0:15:18.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.63,0:15:22.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  我知道当我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I just...I-I know that when...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.20,0:15:25.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从炼狱逃出来后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got puked out of purgatory,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.43,0:15:29.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我用了好几周才适应过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}it took me a few weeks to... find my sea legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.12,0:15:31.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.66,0:15:35.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要想偏了  我很高兴你能回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get me wrong. I'm happy you're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.08,0:15:36.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我快激动死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm freaking thrilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.14,0:15:40.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是神奇复活这事...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just this whole mysterious-resurrection thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.75,0:15:42.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总是会有不好的副作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It always has one mother of a downside.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.67,0:15:47.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你想让我怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.28,0:15:48.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也许可以上去一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe take a trip upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.66,0:15:49.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}To heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.45,0:15:50.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  四处逛一逛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, poke around,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.42,0:15:52.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看上帝使团知不知道你是怎么出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}see if the God squad can't tell us how you got out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.38,0:15:53.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.26,0:15:58.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和你一样烦那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, I-I hate those flying-ass monkeys
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.22,0:15:59.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来飞去的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}just as much as you do, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.60,0:16:01.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我说了不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean! I said no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.23,0:16:18.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和我谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.48,0:16:20.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.96,0:16:29.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我变坏的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was...bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.46,0:16:31.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些不好的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I had all those things...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.64,0:16:36.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些利维坦  在我体内翻滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}The...the leviathans... writhing inside me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.13,0:16:41.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给世间制造了太多苦难\N{\fnArial\fs30}I caused a lot of suffering on earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.08,0:16:43.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我毁灭了天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I devastated heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.63,0:16:46.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我杀害了成千上万的同胞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I vaporized thousands of my own kind,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.55,0:16:49.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I-I-I can't go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.00,0:16:52.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为如果你回去  天使们会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause if you do, the angels will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.60,0:16:56.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为我看清了天堂的模样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if I see what heaven's become...what I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.20,0:17:03.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把它变成的模样  我害怕我会自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}...what I made of it... I'm afraid I might kill myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.05,0:17:10.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有线索了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.73,0:17:14.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  是什么线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Excellent. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.17,0:17:16.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位黑洞  在他抢劫银行前\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this black-hole guy...before he tried the bank,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.48,0:17:18.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他抢劫了盖理猝死的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}he robbed a house across from the park
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.69,0:17:19.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,公园对面的一座房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}where Gary blew a gasket.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.51,0:17:22.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么你觉得那入室抢劫\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, you think the house heist
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.75,0:17:24.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与盖理的死亡之间有联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Gary's corpse are connected?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.08,0:17:25.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根据资料记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to the file,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.77,0:17:27.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这两件事恰好同时发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}they happened at pretty much the exact same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.68,0:17:29.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Check this out. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.92,0:17:34.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是那座房子  盖理死在街对面的这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the house, and Gary died across the street here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.77,0:17:37.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有今早我们去的那个楼在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that building from this morning...right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.04,0:17:37.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑洞也抢劫了那\N{\fnArial\fs30}The black hole hit that, too. 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.98,0:17:40.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我猜猜  不管是谁来了次燕式跳水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess...where, uh, what's his name took a swan dive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.11,0:17:43.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我相信  那其他的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'll bite. What about the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.17,0:17:46.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些是被偷窃的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, those are the places that stuff got stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.39,0:17:47.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是没有人死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}But nobody got dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.80,0:17:49.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了那些涂鸦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take away the graffiti,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.36,0:17:52.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一切都看起来像是普通的砸窗抢劫事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}and these all look like just normal smash-and-grabs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.61,0:17:53.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我打了几通电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I made a few phone calls,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.95,0:17:57.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和当时在场的以及附近居住的人交谈了一番\N{\fnArial\fs30}talked to some people who are nearby...neighbors and whatnot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.45,0:17:59.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们说了一大番难以置信的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they reported a whole lot of crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.18,0:18:00.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.92,0:18:02.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如一个慢跑的人碰烂了头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a jogger bumping his head
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.70,0:18:04.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,长出了四英尺大的肿块\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sprouting a four-inch lump.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.15,0:18:06.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再比如一个孩子走到了墙里听见了鸟叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a kid walking into a wall and hearing birdies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.03,0:18:09.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,基本上  每处抢劫点周围50码内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basically, for 50 yards around each robbery,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.39,0:18:10.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们就像生活在卡通片里\N{\fnArial\fs30}people were living in a cartoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.68,0:18:11.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但持续时间都不长\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it didn't last long.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.71,0:18:13.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每处都是大概持续5至10分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, 5, 10 minutes at each place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.74,0:18:16.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种时间长度足够窃贼进去再出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}About the length of time it would take a thief to get in and out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.04,0:18:17.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.33,0:18:20.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论他用的是什么力量  都不是单个锁定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But whatever power he's using it's...it's not targeted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.31,0:18:23.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说它会影响一片区域\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's...it's kind of like an area of effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.53,0:18:26.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就像是在一个奇怪的气泡中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, picture him in a bubble of weird,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.25,0:18:29.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切碰到它的东西都会变得疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}and anything that touches it gets daffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.73,0:18:33.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是说这个卡通家伙可以穿墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this animaniac can step through walls,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.02,0:18:34.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,投掷铁砧\N{\fnArial\fs30}can toss an anvil?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.10,0:18:35.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  但他是在扭曲事实的基础上做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but he's warping reality to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.20,0:18:37.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以某人恰好在\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if someone happens to be nearby
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.56,0:18:38.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他梦中女孩旁边的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}meeting the girl of his dreams...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.92,0:18:40.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的心脏就会迸出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}His heart makes a break for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.42,0:18:43.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那么砸碎橱窗  保安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so smashing the, uh -- the rent-a-cop --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.34,0:18:45.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是故意的  但其余的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That -- that was on purpose, but the rest of them --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.67,0:18:47.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诡异事件只是巧合吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, is that just collateral weird? 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.52,0:18:48.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.22,0:18:49.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么我们是在找一个窃贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're looking for a thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.55,0:18:51.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有他偷去的存款箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the deposit box he was after.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.67,0:18:54.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  那间屋子  那间办公室  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the house, the office -- 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.20,0:18:55.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他去过的每个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}every place he's hit
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.40,0:18:58.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都属于住在日落之家养老院的某个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}belonged to someone living at the sunset fields retirement home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.52,0:19:00.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你认为我们应该去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you think our guy's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.16,0:19:01.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,值得一试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worth a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.21,0:19:04.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们整装待发  现在是猎兔时节\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Well, let's gear up. It's wabbit season.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.38,0:19:08.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想那个词你发错音了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you pronounced that correctly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.84,0:19:19.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得了  没那么严重吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. It's not that bad. 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.93,0:19:20.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会告诉我这个呼吸机\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't tell me this joint 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.53,0:19:23.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会让你浑身不自在\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't give you the heebs and/or jeebs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.32,0:19:24.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你好  有事吗  -你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. Can I help you? - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.73,0:19:28.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克罗斯比探员  联调局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Agent crosby. FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.89,0:19:30.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  我是德怀特·马霍尼医生  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, I'm Dr. Dwight Mahoney. 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.39,0:19:32.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我经营日落之家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I run sunset fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.93,0:19:35.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要问询你的病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to question your residents.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.28,0:19:37.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  关于什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...why? About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.36,0:19:39.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,主要是关于盗窃案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grand larceny, mostly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.42,0:19:44.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  请随便问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. Um, by all means, ask away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.06,0:19:45.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果有事需要帮忙  请通知我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's anything I can do to help, let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.96,0:19:47.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  太好了  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Appreciate it. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.77,0:19:51.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们办正事  你们俩不要调情\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's do this. No flirting, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.41,0:19:57.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真是太帅了  查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are so pretty, Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.68,0:20:02.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是我的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.02,0:20:07.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你太像我的第三任丈夫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! You look so much like my third husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.87,0:20:12.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夫人  我们来此是为了调查盗窃案\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here to talk about the robbery, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.51,0:20:13.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-盗窃案  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Robbery? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.82,0:20:16.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几天前警察找你谈过此案\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one the police talked to you about a few days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.97,0:20:18.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人闯进你的老房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone broke into your old house
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.47,0:20:20.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还偷走了一摞无记名债券\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stole a stack of bearer bonds
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.31,0:20:23.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和你藏在地板下的一些首饰\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, uh, some jewelry that you stashed under your floorboards.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.26,0:20:26.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  是我的钻石  我把它们藏在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my diamonds, yes. I hid them there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.35,0:20:28.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.43,0:20:30.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我信不过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.91,0:20:33.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可是个无赖之徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were quite the bounder.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.11,0:20:36.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你告诉过任何人贵重物品的藏身之处吗  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you tell anyone where your valuables were, 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.82,0:20:37.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,塔特夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Tate?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.80,0:20:39.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.75,0:20:42.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过有时我有些糊涂\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then I get a little fuzzy sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.69,0:20:44.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最近有注意到什么奇怪的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you noticed anything strange lately --
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.33,0:20:46.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,气温骤冷  气味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, cold spots, smells?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.10,0:20:50.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那儿有只猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's the cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.87,0:20:51.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一只猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.95,0:20:54.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它有时会说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He talks sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.28,0:20:57.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对老鼠可是恨之入骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really hates that mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.31,0:21:01.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去审讯那只猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll interrogate the cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.77,0:21:07.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你吃完了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all done here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.24,0:21:09.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.01,0:21:15.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很诡异  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's creepy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.36,0:21:17.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很多老人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of these people --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.39,0:21:20.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们对外界充耳不闻  只活在自己的世界里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just tune out and live in their own heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.44,0:21:23.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就好像现实世界过于复杂  他们无法承受\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like maybe the real world is too much for them,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.72,0:21:25.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们只能逃避  你明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they just run and hide, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.10,0:21:33.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,汤好了  还有咸味酱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soup's on... and semi-edible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.75,0:21:38.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.41,0:21:40.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸曾在军队服役  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad was in the army, 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.15,0:21:42.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以小时候我们经常搬家\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we moved around a lot when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.32,0:21:44.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃意大利面条和热狗是我们搬进新家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having spaghetti and hot dogs our first night in a new house
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.94,0:21:47.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-第一晚的传统  -明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- was sort of a tradition. - All right. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.81,0:21:50.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸爸曾在海军陆战队服役\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, my father was in the marines.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.60,0:21:51.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,锅盖头(对海军陆战队士兵的谐称)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jarhead, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.71,0:21:54.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  第一海军陆战队二营回音兵团  \N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. Uh, 2nd battalion, first marines, echo company.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.50,0:21:58.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直以为他们有些趾高气扬 \N{\fnArial\fs30}I always thought they were a little puffed up, myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.32,0:22:02.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  我知道什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, hey. What do I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.34,0:22:03.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只不是一个老步兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just an old grunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.83,0:22:05.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我的老步兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my old grunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.45,0:22:14.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾米告诉我你没有参过军\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Ame tells me you never served.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.49,0:22:16.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.21,0:22:17.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看  我很难相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I find that hard to believe
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.65,0:22:20.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我不得不说  萨姆  \N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I got to say, Sam, 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.05,0:22:21.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有那种神色\N{\fnArial\fs30}you got the look.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.07,0:22:23.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神色\N{\fnArial\fs30}The look?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.89,0:22:25.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很多人在历经了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one a lot of guys get after 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.23,0:22:26.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战场的血腥后的神色\N{\fnArial\fs30}they've been through the meat grinder --
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.57,0:22:27.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那种神色能让你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one that let's you know 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.23,0:22:29.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们见识过许多难以忘怀的场面\N{\fnArial\fs30}they've seen a lot of crap they can't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.77,0:22:32.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一旦他们的脚踏上土地\N{\fnArial\fs30}The second their feet hit solid ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.80,0:22:34.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们开始奔跑  并且不会停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}they start running, and they don't stop --
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.90,0:22:37.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到他们找到可以依靠的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not till they find something to hold on to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.88,0:22:39.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为我是这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think that's what I'm doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.71,0:22:41.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是找个依靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just holding on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.42,0:22:48.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认为你们彼此互相依靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the two of you are holding on to each other, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.61,0:22:51.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我知道她很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I know she's scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.63,0:22:54.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唐牺牲后  我没有责备她离我而去\N{\fnArial\fs30}After what happened to Don, I don't blame her for taking off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.99,0:22:58.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道她为什么要逃避现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Needing to run away and hide -- I know why she did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.01,0:23:03.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题是  萨姆  你在逃避什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is -- what are you running from, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.56,0:23:09.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有收获吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.53,0:23:15.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  没有魔法袋  没有电磁干扰  你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, um, nothing. Uh, no hex bags, no EMF. You?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.72,0:23:16.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一无所获\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.61,0:23:19.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一半我问过的人都不记得被抢劫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half the folks I talked to don't even remember being robbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.58,0:23:24.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.02,0:23:28.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你记得一个叫弗雷德·琼斯的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember a guy named Fred Jones?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.64,0:23:30.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得他和爸爸有联系  他住在盐湖外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he was a contact of dad's, lived outside of salt lake. 
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.66,0:23:32.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得  我的第一瓶啤酒就是他给的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that guy gave me my first beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.32,0:23:33.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得那是我还没满十岁呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even think I was double digits.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.28,0:23:36.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我也是  他是个通灵师  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, yeah. Me, too. Um, he was psychic, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.64,0:23:38.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心灵致动师  问这个干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Psychokinetic. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.51,0:23:42.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他就在114号房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause he's in room 114.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.73,0:23:47.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.15,0:23:49.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我差点让它奔溃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've almost cracked him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.78,0:23:50.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.35,0:23:55.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和你还没完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. I'm not through with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.91,0:24:00.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.05,0:24:09.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琼斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Jones?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.80,0:24:13.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  我是 萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's, uh, Sam Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.88,0:24:16.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弗雷德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fred?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.02,0:24:21.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我太紧张了  快叫医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}My nerves! Get me a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.79,0:24:23.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弗雷德  嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fred! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.90,0:24:27.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  你真的认为这个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you really think this one man
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.73,0:24:30.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这几起惨案的罪魁祸首\N{\fnArial\fs30}is causing all of these... shenanigans?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.73,0:24:31.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if he is,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.48,0:24:33.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他周围肯定会有蹊跷  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'd be surrounded by a circle of crazy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.73,0:24:37.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.00,0:24:51.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猜对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.60,0:24:53.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.82,0:24:54.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弗雷德与众不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fred's got juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.79,0:24:56.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说一般的心灵致动师能用意念移动物体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, an average psychokinetic can move things with his mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.90,0:24:58.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是像弗雷德\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a guy like Fred -- 
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.58,0:25:00.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要是激怒他  他就能改写现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}you get him worked up, He can reshape reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.82,0:25:02.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  但是如何屏蔽他的超能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so where's his "Off" Switch? 
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.42,0:25:03.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.33,0:25:05.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我甚至都不确定他是否知道我们在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not even certain if he knows we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.86,0:25:07.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要杀了他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we...kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.93,0:25:09.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打扰  探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.00,0:25:12.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他刚才是不是威胁要谋杀我的病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he just threaten to murder one of my patients?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.82,0:25:17.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺利到让人感到诡异\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real freaking smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.38,0:25:19.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不必丢下他不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we don't have to leave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.38,0:25:20.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能瞬间移动他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could teleport him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.34,0:25:21.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弗雷德能影响到周边  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fred's radioactive, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.02,0:25:23.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直接挪走他  谁知道会出什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zap him -- no telling what will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.84,0:25:25.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚我和萨姆会杀个回马枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Sam will circle back tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.36,0:25:26.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干净利落地接走弗雷德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get Fred nice and clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.69,0:25:29.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你悄悄行事看着他一点  听见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go invisible girl and keep an eye on him. You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.20,0:25:34.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.03,0:25:49.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生日快乐  希拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy birthday, Sheila.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.47,0:26:03.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.08,0:26:08.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好  猛吸一口气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get ready. Big breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.55,0:26:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.28,0:26:27.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来擦干净你的脸  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just gonna wipe this off your face, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.27,0:26:29.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要给你戴上这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just gonna put this on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.81,0:26:37.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你收到我的信息了  很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. You got my message. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.78,0:26:39.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底出了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.64,0:26:41.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是蛋糕出了不幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a pastry mishap.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.74,0:26:42.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, and?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.88,0:26:44.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后那些霜糖喷溅的速度接近超音速\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the frosting reached near-supersonic speeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.96,0:26:45.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.59,0:26:46.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弗雷德不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Fred's gone. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.99,0:26:48.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  真他妈的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Oh, fan-freaking-tastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.43,0:26:49.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真该挖了你的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Way to take your eye off the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.99,0:26:51.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不该来这儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not supposed to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.28,0:26:54.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我亲爱的  你还有更要紧的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, trust me, sweetheart, you got bigger fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.21,0:26:56.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查尔斯  她戴着我的钻石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles, she's wearing my diamonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.77,0:26:57.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.88,0:26:59.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  有什么不对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.06,0:27:02.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是塔特夫人的手链\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Mrs. Tate's bracelet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.76,0:27:04.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从哪儿弄来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.04,0:27:06.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回答问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.27,0:27:07.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我男朋友给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My boyfriend gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.61,0:27:25.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看  不记名债券\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Bearer bonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.26,0:27:27.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许这些都是希拉·塔特的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe these belonged to Sheila Tate.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.27,0:27:28.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙就是我们要找的贼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this man is our thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.97,0:27:31.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.33,0:27:48.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.67,0:27:53.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,待着别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay still.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.06,0:27:55.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿开你的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.55,0:28:14.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.92,0:28:16.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他自有办法  萨姆来帮一把  -你怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Guy eats his wheaties. Sam, come on. - What did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.38,0:28:19.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起来  坐好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up. Come on. Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.09,0:28:20.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你们刚刚把我怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second! What did you just do to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.97,0:28:22.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说  弗雷德·琼斯在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey! Listen to me. Where is Fred Jones?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.38,0:28:24.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  是他把他带走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I -- he -- he took him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.40,0:28:25.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.78,0:28:28.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马霍尼医生  那家伙就是个魔鬼懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Mahoney. That guy's evil, man, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.76,0:28:31.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他在利用琼斯先生  -怎么利用\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's using Mr. Jones  - How?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.43,0:28:34.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弗雷德只是看看卡通  但他太不可思议了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, all Fred does is watch cartoons, but he is magic, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.16,0:28:35.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几个星期前  我的脚撞上了他的门\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few weeks ago, I-I slammed my foot in his door.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.96,0:28:37.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把门撞扁了  我意思是真扁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I smashed it flat -- and I mean flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.22,0:28:39.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来我晃了晃门  它就恢复了原状\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then when I shook the thing, it popped back up,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.22,0:28:41.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像是从卡通片里出来似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like something out of a cartoon or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.48,0:28:42.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对对  我们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, yeah, we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.64,0:28:45.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我就告诉了马霍尼医生  他开始了实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I told dr. Mahoney, and then he started doing experiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.76,0:28:47.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只想看看他能做些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just -- we just wanted to see what he could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.71,0:28:48.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些盗窃案呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the robberies?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.68,0:28:50.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马霍尼已经在日落之家捞了好些年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Mahoney's been skimming off Sunset Fields for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.75,0:28:52.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些老人中有不少都藏了些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of those folks -- they got stuff stashed away,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.55,0:28:53.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是没有登记的那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}like, off the books.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.32,0:28:55.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以马霍尼会去找那些财物\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Mahoney would track down the loot,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.78,0:28:57.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也会带弗雷德一起出去兜兜风\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then we would take Fred for a drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.57,0:28:59.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  再用他那些诡异的招数偷窃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, and use his bubble of weird to rip people off.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.15,0:29:01.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么搞到中枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you end up gut-shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.43,0:29:03.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马霍尼  他碾碎了那个保安之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mahoney -- after -- after he anviled that guard,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.17,0:29:05.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他有点害怕了  你们也出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he started freaking out, and then you showed up,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.44,0:29:08.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蛋糕又在休息室里爆开了花  然后他失控了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then the cake blew in the day room, and then he lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.47,0:29:09.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说"他失控了"是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean, "He lost it"?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.63,0:29:11.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说他现在正在去银行的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean he's on his way back to 
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.64,0:29:12.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想最后一搏\N{\fnArial\fs30}the bank right now for one last score.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.82,0:29:14.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,医生到处为非作歹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc's blowing town.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.15,0:29:16.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  他说弗雷德是个累赘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he said that Fred was a loose end.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.69,0:29:17.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他打算杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was gonna kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.21,0:29:19.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可我喜欢弗雷德\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I like Fred,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.27,0:29:20.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就说如果你要伤害他  我就报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I said that if he hurt the guy, I'd go to the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.43,0:29:22.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道他有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I didn't know that he had a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.72,0:29:23.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.67,0:29:30.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得琼斯先生知道发生了什么事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think Mr. Jones knows what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.71,0:29:31.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.86,0:29:33.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这个老伙计就好像活在梦境之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems to me like the dude's living in a dream world.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.59,0:29:46.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我是想帮忙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I am trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.34,0:29:49.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子  我跟你说  如果唐能看见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, I'll tell you, if Don could see you...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.18,0:29:51.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别  别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't. Just don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.25,0:29:57.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能  你该回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't -- you need to come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.52,0:29:59.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来就是为了这个  为了劝我回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that why you're here -- to drag me back?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.35,0:29:59.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.94,0:30:02.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种生活  不会长久\N{\fnArial\fs30}This -- it won't last.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.58,0:30:04.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这是活在梦境之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are living in a dream world.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.51,0:30:06.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢这地方  我喜欢这房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like it here. I like this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.25,0:30:07.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.23,0:30:09.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆简直一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam is a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.67,0:30:10.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.86,0:30:14.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可我和萨姆在一起的时候我很开心  爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when I'm with Sam, I'm happy, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.69,0:30:17.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经很久没这么开心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I haven't been happy in a really long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.82,0:30:22.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  就让我们两个同病相怜吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So please, just... let us be messes together.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.02,0:30:24.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我们一个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.05,0:30:46.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来擦干\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.88,0:30:53.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面是你的车吗  那辆英帕拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that your car outside -- the Impala?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.62,0:30:56.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  以前是我爸的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it was my Dad's.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.60,0:30:58.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爸好品味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy had good taste...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.49,0:31:01.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对一个当兵的来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}...for a jarhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.38,0:31:19.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  琼斯肯定就在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Jones has got to be close.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.24,0:31:21.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去银行看看  你们看看能不能找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll hit the bank. You see if you can find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.93,0:31:48.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.38,0:31:57.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你感觉到了吗  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you feel that, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.24,0:31:59.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那股力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}The power.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.32,0:32:07.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的女侠简恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calamity Jane for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.37,0:32:09.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弗雷德  喂  弗雷德  老伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fred, hey. Fred, hey, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.92,0:32:12.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弗雷德  听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey, Fred? Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.98,0:32:14.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听得到我说话吗  弗雷德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hear me? Fred!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.54,0:32:16.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能跟他说上话就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we could just talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.25,0:32:18.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.52,0:32:19.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醒醒  醒醒啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wake up. Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.02,0:32:21.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.51,0:32:23.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.38,0:32:41.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  我们这是在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, uh, where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.02,0:32:43.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在琼斯先生的脑海里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside Mr. Jones' mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.85,0:32:46.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说想跟他说话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you wanted to talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.27,0:32:48.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.64,0:32:55.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弗雷德  弗雷德  是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fred. Fred. Um, hey, it's -- it's -- it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.50,0:32:58.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm, uh -- I'm sam -- Sam Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.93,0:33:01.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约翰的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}John's boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.82,0:33:02.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.12,0:33:03.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骨瘦如柴的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The scrawny one?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.14,0:33:08.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不见你才三四年吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only been three, four years since I've seen you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.75,0:33:10.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是差不多二十年\N{\fnArial\fs30}You -- more like, uh, 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.72,0:33:15.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着弗雷德  我要你集中精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Fred, I'm gonna need you to focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.37,0:33:17.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.35,0:33:21.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来这干吗  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.01,0:33:29.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up, doc?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.45,0:33:33.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不  你们在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no, no. You're lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.23,0:33:37.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是事实  琼斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is happening, Mr. Jones.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.24,0:33:38.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在利用你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're using you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.77,0:33:41.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我当什么  变态人体电池么\N{\fnArial\fs30}As what-- some kind of a damn psychic coppertop?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.15,0:33:43.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我插上  然后全世界都乱套了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You plug me in, and the whole world goes wacky?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.89,0:33:45.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不是这样的  -你怎么知道不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It doesn't work that way. - How would you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.42,0:33:48.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无意冒犯  但在我看来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense, but it seems to me
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.57,0:33:49.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像你在这里的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}like you've been spending more time in here
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.97,0:33:52.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比在外面还长\N{\fnArial\fs30}than you have... out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.60,0:33:58.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想知道拥有这样头脑的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to know what's the worst thing that can happen
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.87,0:34:01.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最怕发生什么事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to a guy who's got a mind like I got?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.31,0:34:04.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是失去这个头脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Losing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.10,0:34:10.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你放我走  这东西一半都归你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let me walk, and half of this is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.40,0:34:15.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm gonna pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.06,0:34:17.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还真不太喜欢偷老太太们的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not really into stealing from sweet old ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.16,0:34:18.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是从她们那里偷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not stealing from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.28,0:34:19.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我偷的是她们孩子的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm stealing from their children.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.70,0:34:23.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小混蛋们觉得他们可以把家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little bastards think they can drop their folks off at a home
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.07,0:34:24.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放在养老院  然后每年来看两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}and visit twice a year, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.55,0:34:27.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我照顾这些老家伙们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took care of all these old geezers.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.19,0:34:28.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我有资格  -我不关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think I des-- - I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.34,0:34:30.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.35,0:34:33.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.08,0:34:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到游乐园\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the fun house.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.71,0:34:45.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡通片  我小时候就喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cartoons-- yeah, yeah, I always loved them when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.68,0:34:49.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们令我感到开心和安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}They made me feel... happy-- safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.66,0:34:50.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们是\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.23,0:34:52.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以依赖的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something to hold on to.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.97,0:34:54.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.98,0:34:59.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(迪恩·温彻斯特   英勇的猎人)
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.20,0:35:01.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(马霍尼医生  邪恶的怪人)
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.06,0:35:18.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放弃了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.08,0:35:20.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几个月来  我一直活在这种疯狂中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been dealing with this crazy for months!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.29,0:35:24.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个白痴还带枪来打架\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you-- idiot -- bring a gun to a gag fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.41,0:35:26.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我是带了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I did bring this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.95,0:35:29.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个叉可是个标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}And "X" marks the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.90,0:35:37.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你停止这些  控制住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to stop this-- take control.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.80,0:35:40.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太难了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.35,0:35:42.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  活在梦想的世界很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it can be nice living in a dream world.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.97,0:35:44.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那感觉非常棒  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can be great. I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.94,0:35:45.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you can hide,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.48,0:35:47.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还可以假装外界都不存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you can pretend all the crap out there doesn't exist,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.85,0:35:51.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你不能永远这样  因为最终\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you can't do it forever because...eventually,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.83,0:35:55.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论你在逃避什么  它都会找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever it is you're running from-- it'll find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.14,0:35:58.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它会找上门  给你致使一击\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll come along, and it'll punch you in the gut.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.52,0:35:59.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.84,0:36:04.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须醒过来  因为如果你不醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you got to wake up, because if you don't,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.52,0:36:08.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让梦一直这样下去的话  会毁了你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}then trying to keep that dream alive will destroy you!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.34,0:36:10.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会毁了一切的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll destroy everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.34,0:36:32.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,貌似有人关掉了那蠢管道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like somebody turned off the boob tube.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.38,0:36:36.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  那我就可以用这个了 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Means I can use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.34,0:36:38.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! 
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.86,0:36:42.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要再伤害任何人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are never going to hurt anyone again!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.06,0:36:57.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结束了  伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.03,0:37:08.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}My god.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.53,0:37:15.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弗雷德  你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fred. You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.21,0:37:17.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.67,0:37:20.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个月后  一年后\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a month, a year...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.84,0:37:24.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人越老会越不灵光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody gets sharper with age.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.98,0:37:28.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会再失控的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna lose control again,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.55,0:37:32.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还会有人再受伤的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and somebody's gonna get hurt...again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.55,0:37:36.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to make it stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.83,0:37:40.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能有个办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There might be a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.44,0:37:46.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过程可能很痛苦  而且结束的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}The procedure will be painful, and...when it's over,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.76,0:37:50.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不确定你还能有多少意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure how much of you will be left.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.07,0:38:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你还等什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.34,0:38:08.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他  他还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he, uh -- is he okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.62,0:38:13.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在听欢乐颂\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's listening to "Ode to Joy."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.03,0:38:17.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他很快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.52,0:38:22.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们把这白蚁窝毁了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, let's blow this termite terrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.44,0:38:25.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡斯  你可以坐前排了  干得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, you get to ride shotgun. You done good.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.57,0:38:26.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  可我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, but I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.65,0:38:30.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能去了  我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't come. I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.93,0:38:35.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好啊  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.56,0:38:37.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.48,0:38:39.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.49,0:38:42.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你在想什么  我不允许\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see what you're thinking, and I won't allow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.51,0:38:43.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.26,0:38:45.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直努力假装\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been trying to pretend
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.82,0:38:49.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以忘掉自己在天堂做的事  但我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I can escape what I did in heaven, but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.04,0:38:52.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些我所引起的伤痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that pain that I caused--
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.21,0:38:54.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得回来去纠正错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I have to come back, to make things right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.83,0:38:57.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你正在这样做  听令行事就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are... by doing what you're told.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.90,0:39:01.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,底线是  除非我响铃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bottom line-- unless I ring my bell,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.60,0:39:03.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则别回天堂  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}you stay out of heaven, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.71,0:39:06.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我该做什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.30,0:39:09.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.27,0:39:16.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  小卡  为什么你不能一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You-- you what, Cass? W-why can't you come with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.43,0:39:19.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.32,0:39:24.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想和琼斯先生一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to stay with Mr. Jones.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.58,0:39:28.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得有人照看他几天  保证他安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone should watch over him for a few days just to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.04,0:39:30.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  之后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, and then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.59,0:39:31.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.42,0:39:35.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我知道我不能再逃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know I can't run anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.59,0:39:42.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾米利亚扮演糖果仙子  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Ame is playing the sugarplum fairy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.06,0:39:42.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.57,0:39:44.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是她的关键时刻  你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this is her big moment, you understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.71,0:39:46.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-她摇晃着走上台  -摇晃着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And she waddles up onto the stage -- -Waddles?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.44,0:39:49.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  你那时是个胖丫头  很可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You were a chubby kid. It was adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.50,0:39:52.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她摇晃着走上台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, she waddles up onto the stage,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.60,0:39:55.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,背后还拖着两英尺的厕纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she is dragging two feet of toilet paper behind her.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.18,0:39:56.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.32,0:40:00.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.68,0:40:01.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.44,0:40:04.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,职业生涯的正式终结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officially the end of her career.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.02,0:40:06.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-来一瓶吗  -好的  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want one of these? - Please, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.15,0:40:10.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.78,0:40:18.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我哥哥以前就这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}My, uh-- my brother used to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.60,0:40:19.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是吗  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.76,0:40:21.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他是个好人吗  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He a good guy? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.73,0:40:25.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  他是最棒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, uh, he-- he was...the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.26,0:40:28.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  我失去他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I, uh... I lost him, 
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.71,0:40:30.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跑掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, uh, I-I ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.42,0:40:34.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真抱歉听到这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to hear about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.73,0:40:39.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.31,0:40:41.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.82,0:40:44.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.95,0:40:56.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾米利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amelia?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.63,0:41:00.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝  你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby? You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.89,0:41:04.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Don.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.30,0:41:07.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.89,0:41:16.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  跟我走不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you with me?
